  If you use this software, please cite as:

  Adams, T., Salimi, Y., Ay, M. C., Valderrama, D. F., Jacobs, M., & Fröhlich, H. (2025).
  A benchmark of text embedding models for semantic harmonization of Alzheimer's disease cohorts.
  The Journal of Prevention of Alzheimer's Disease, 13(1).
  https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tjpad.2025.100420
